d with this place","texts":{"en":"Gatsby recounts leading his machine-gun battalion in the Argonne Forest during the war.","it":"Gatsby racconta di aver guidato il proprio battaglione di mitraglieri nella foresta delle Argonne durante la guerra.","fr":"Gatsby raconte avoir mené son bataillon de mitrailleurs dans la forêt d’Argonne pendant la guerre.","es":"Gatsby cuenta que dirigió su batallón de ametralladoras en el bosque de Argonne durante la guerra."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"asheville","collection":"cited","name":"Asheville","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"9100e0bf50ee63dad047566e67f62b079d3578e668e1f923b2da40aca81313d9","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Nick recognises Jordan from photographs of sporting life at Asheville and other resorts.","it":"Nick riconosce Jordan dalle fotografie della vita sportiva ad Asheville e in altre località di villeggiatura.","fr":"Nick reconnaît Jordan grâce aux photographies de la vie sportive à Asheville et dans d’autres stations.","es":"Nick reconoce a Jordan por fotografías de la vida deportiva en Asheville y otros lugares de veraneo."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"atlantic","collection":"cited","name":"Atlantic City","noteHash":"1e65335f06f936602032d7b068584b05","positionSource":"756408e3668f695f3663cc88ed9925cdd16853cc972c51147b443f70f1c458c7","narrativeSource":null,"description":{"status":"reviewed","reviewedAt":"2026-11-04","basis":"existing geographic and literary sources associated with this place","texts":{"en":"Atlantic City is suggested as a destination for a week away.","it":"Atlantic City viene suggerita come meta per trascorrere una settimana fuori.","fr":"Atlantic City est suggérée comme destination pour une semaine d’évasion.","es":"Atlantic City se propone como destino para pasar una semana fuera."}}},{"book":"gatsby","id":"bois","collection"